  <p align="left" class="BodyTextSpaced">Scott tends to do more RPG editing than writing and design work &#151; partly because he really likes editing; partly because DMing and novel writing takes up enough of his creative energy as it is.  To the left are a selection of things he's written for people other than himself.</p>
